# Vercel uploads the whole workspace because the portal's Root Directory
# (apps/portal) depends on packages/* outside it. These paths are needed by
# nobody at build time and add ~46 MB to every deploy.

CONDOMINIUM PROJECTS/
Development_Guide/
scripts/seed/
image.png

# apps/internal is deliberately NOT listed. It is a declared npm workspace, and
# removing its package.json makes the install step fail lockfile validation.
# Its tracked source is 1.3 MB, so excluding it would buy nothing anyway.
